<title>MEXICO: Mexico's dollar CCP rate falls in October.</title>
<headline>Mexico's dollar CCP rate falls in October.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's dollar CCP rate fell three basis points in October from the previous month to 7.05 percent, the Banco de Mexico said.</p>
<p>The central bank said that the CCP, the average bank term desposit cost measured in dollars in Mexican banks, was 7.08 percent in September.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7902</p>
